<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Novellus upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Novellus upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it upgraded Novellus Systems Inc, adding the stock to its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Goldman previously rated the stock market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Novellus gained 7/8 to 55-5/8.</p>
</text>
